---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Writing
description: Essays, notes, and conference reflections about building humane software.
permalink: "/writing/"
---

<section class="hero">
  <h1 class="hero__title">Writing</h1>
  <p class="hero__subtitle">Essays, talks, and notes about engineering leadership, product development, and the craft of writing software.</p>
</section>

<div class="grid">
  {% for post in collections.writing %}
    <article class="card">
      <p class="card__kicker">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</p>
      <h2 class="card__title"><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
      <p>{{ post.data.summary }}</p>
      <div class="card__actions"><a href="{{ post.url }}">Read more →</a></div>
    </article>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
